## FINDING 1 -- A SOFT 404 IS A 200 TO EVERY HEALTH CHECK THE DESK RUNS

`ftmo.com/en/leaderboards/` returns **status 404 with a 203,448-byte marketing body**.
`darwinex.com/darwins` returns **404 with 32,616 bytes**. Both had been re-requested every 15
minutes for 88 runs. A byte-count or non-empty check reads both as healthy; only the status
code separates them, and only a streak counter makes 88 identical days visible as one fact
rather than 88 quiet ones. Same class as the desk's own 2026-08-29 note (a 200 can be a PoW
challenge) with the sign reversed: there the status lied optimistic, here the BODY does.

Verified destroyed-at-source, not moved: darwinex.com/sitemap_en.xml is a 15-URL marketing
sitemap with no /darwin/ page in it at all.

## FINDING 2 -- THE MQL5 LISTING SHIPS THE TRACK RECORD, NOT JUST THE LINK

Repairing mql5_signals turned up more than a selector. Each `signal-card` on the free listing
carries author, star rating with vote count, growth %, AND

    <input value="[1756598400,0,1756684800,-2.4,...,1788393600,509.38]">

-- a **full W1 equity curve per signal, on the listing page**. 28 weekly points on the first
card. The old parser wanted `href="/en/signals/123"` followed immediately by a text node; live
markup has a `?source=...` query string and nests the title three spans deep, so it matched
nothing on a page carrying 2,446 cards. The repair yields **160 track records with equity
curves per sweep** where the desk was getting one raw_capture row -- and the curve is the
payload the desk was previously paying a per-signal fetch for, or not getting at all.

## FINDING 3 -- QUANTCONNECT SHIPS A MECHANISM SENTENCE PER THREAD

260 consecutive dark sweeps. The forum list is client-rendered, so `/forum/discussion/` appears
literally TWICE in the HTML of a page carrying dozens of threads -- the old link selector was
not wrong, it was pointed at markup that no longer exists. The bootstrap JSON carries every
thread with a one-line `summary`: "A trader is struggling with slippage in mean reversion equity
strategies, and wonders if negative and positive slippage evens out." That is a mechanism
sentence per thread, free, without opening any of them. 19 real rows this sweep.

